151-[{<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;text&#x27;</span>: <span class="hljs-string">&quot;How AP reported in all formats from tor...},
152- {&#x27;text&#x27;: &#x27;Did you know you have two little yellow...}]</span><!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <ul data-svelte-h="svelte-1k3qv71"><li><a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.skip">IterableDataset.skip()</a> omits the first <code>n</code> examples in a dataset and returns the remaining examples:</li></ul> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>train_dataset = shuffled_dataset.skip(<span class="hljs-number">1000</span>)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <blockquote class="warning" data-svelte-h="svelte-15ctcgr"><p><code>take</code> and <code>skip</code> prevent future calls to <code>shuffle</code> because they lock in the order of the shards. You should <code>shuffle</code> your dataset before splitting it.</p></blockquote> <a id="interleave_datasets"></a>  <h3 class="relative group"><a id="shard" class="header-link block pr-1.5 text-lg no-hover:hidden with-hover:absolute with-hover:p-1.5 with-hover:opacity-0 with-hover:group-hover:opacity-100 with-hover:right-full" href="#shard"><span><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a> <span>Shard</span></h3> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-49tx6i">🤗 Datasets supports sharding to divide a very large dataset into a predefined number of chunks. Specify the <code>num_shards</code> parameter in <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.shard">shard()</a> to determine the number of shards to split the dataset into. You’ll also need to provide the shard you want to return with the <code>index</code> parameter.</p> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-qwvsg3">For example, the <a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/fancyzhx/amazon_polarity" rel="nofollow">amazon_polarity</a> dataset has 4 shards (in this case they are 4 Parquet files):</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> datasets <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> load_dataset
153-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset = load_dataset(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;fancyzhx/amazon_polarity&quot;</span>, split=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;train&quot;</span>, streaming=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>)
154-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(dataset)
155-IterableDataset({
156-    features: [<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;label&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;title&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;content&#x27;</span>],
157-    num_shards: <span class="hljs-number">4</span>
158-})<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-bcezc5">After sharding the dataset into two chunks, the first one will only have 2 shards:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset.shard(num_shards=<span class="hljs-number">2</span>, index=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)
159-IterableDataset({
160-    features: [<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;label&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;title&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;content&#x27;</span>],
161-    num_shards: <span class="hljs-number">2</span>
162-})<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1mu1224">To increase the number of shards of a dataset, you can use <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.reshard">IterableDataset.reshard()</a>:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset.reshard()
163-IterableDataset({
164-    features: [<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;label&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;title&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;content&#x27;</span>],
165-    num_shards: <span class="hljs-number">3600</span>
166-})<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1kz6yj2">The resharding mechanism depends on the dataset file format.
167-For example for Parquet, it reshards using row groups instead of having one file per shard.
168-See how it works for every format in <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.reshard">IterableDataset.reshard()</a>’s documentation.</p> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1q8p1co">If your dataset has <code>dataset.num_shards==1</code> even after resharding, you should chunk it using <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.skip">IterableDataset.skip()</a> and <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.take">IterableDataset.take()</a> instead.</p>  <h2 class="relative group"><a id="concatenate" class="header-link block pr-1.5 text-lg no-hover:hidden with-hover:absolute with-hover:p-1.5 with-hover:opacity-0 with-hover:group-hover:opacity-100 with-hover:right-full" href="#concatenate"><span><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a> <span>Concatenate</span></h2> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-186izkl">Separate datasets can be concatenated if they share the same column types. Concatenate datasets with <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.concatenate_datasets">concatenate_datasets()</a>:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> datasets <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> concatenate_datasets, load_dataset
169-
170-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>stories = load_dataset(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ajibawa-2023/General-Stories-Collection&quot;</span>, split=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;train&quot;</span>, streaming=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>)
171-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>stories = stories.select_columns([<span class="hljs-string">&quot;text&quot;</span>])  <span class="hljs-comment"># only keep the &#x27;text&#x27; column</span>
172-IterableDataset({
173-    features: Unknown,
174-    num_shards: <span class="hljs-number">10</span>
175-})
176-
177-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>wiki = load_dataset(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;wikimedia/wikipedia&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;20231101.en&quot;</span>, split=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;train&quot;</span>, streaming=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>)
178-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>wiki = wiki.select_columns([<span class="hljs-string">&quot;text&quot;</span>])  <span class="hljs-comment"># only keep the &#x27;text&#x27; column</span>
179-IterableDataset({
180-    features: [<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;text&#x27;</span>],
181-    num_shards: <span class="hljs-number">41</span>
182-})
183-
184-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>bert_dataset = concatenate_datasets([stories, wiki])
185-IterableDataset({
186-    features: [<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;text&#x27;</span>],
187-    num_shards: <span class="hljs-number">51</span>
188-})<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-kj20hw">The shards of the concatenated dataset are the shards of the input datasets.</p> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-qilcw">You can also concatenate two datasets horizontally by setting <code>axis=1</code> as long as the datasets have the same number of rows:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> datasets <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> IterableDataset
189-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>stories_ids = IterableDataset.from_dict({<span class="hljs-string">&quot;ids&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">list</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(num_stories))})
190-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>stories_with_ids = concatenate_datasets([stories, stories_ids], axis=<span class="hljs-number">1</span>)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1ixwkkj">In this case, the concatenated dataset only has 1 shard, to avoid ending with unaligned shards from the input datasets.</p>  <h2 class="relative group"><a id="interleave" class="header-link block pr-1.5 text-lg no-hover:hidden with-hover:absolute with-hover:p-1.5 with-hover:opacity-0 with-hover:group-hover:opacity-100 with-hover:right-full" href="#interleave"><span><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a> <span>Interleave</span></h2> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1vb4rot"><a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.interleave_datasets">interleave_datasets()</a> can combine an <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset">IterableDataset</a> with other datasets if they have the same column types. The combined dataset returns alternating examples from each of the original datasets.</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> datasets <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> interleave_datasets
191-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>es_dataset = load_dataset(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;allenai/c4&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;es&#x27;</span>, split=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;train&#x27;</span>, streaming=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>)
192-IterableDataset({
193-    features: Unknown,
194-    num_shards: <span class="hljs-number">2048</span>
195-})
196-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>fr_dataset = load_dataset(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;allenai/c4&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;fr&#x27;</span>, split=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;train&#x27;</span>, streaming=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>)
197-IterableDataset({
198-    features: Unknown,
199-    num_shards: <span class="hljs-number">2048</span>
200-})
201-
202-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>multilingual_dataset = interleave_datasets([es_dataset, fr_dataset])
203-IterableDataset({
204-    features: [<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;text&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;timestamp&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;url&#x27;</span>],
205-    num_shards: <span class="hljs-number">2048</span>
206-})
207-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-built_in">list</span>(multilingual_dataset.take(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>))
208-[{<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;text&#x27;</span>: <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;Comprar Zapatillas para niña en chancla con goma por...&#x27;</span>},
209- {<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;text&#x27;</span>: <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;Le sacre de philippe ier, 23 mai 1059 - Compte Rendu...&#x27;</span>}]<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1t5oa18">Define sampling probabilities from each of the original datasets for more control over how each of them are sampled and combined. Set the <code>probabilities</code> argument with your desired sampling probabilities:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>multilingual_dataset_with_oversampling = interleave_datasets([es_dataset, fr_dataset], probabilities=[<span class="hljs-number">0.8</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.2</span>], seed=<span class="hljs-number">42</span>)
210-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-built_in">list</span>(multilingual_dataset_with_oversampling.take(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>))
211-[{<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;text&#x27;</span>: <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;Comprar Zapatillas para niña en chancla con goma por...&#x27;</span>},
212- {<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;text&#x27;</span>: <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;Chevrolet Cavalier Usados en Bogota - Carros en Vent...&#x27;</span>}]<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1p1jghf">Around 80% of the final dataset is made of the <code>es_dataset</code>, and 20% of the <code>fr_dataset</code>.</p> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1pw4uir">You can also specify the <code>stopping_strategy</code>. The default strategy, <code>first_exhausted</code>, is a subsampling strategy, i.e the dataset construction is stopped as soon one of the dataset runs out of samples.
213-You can specify <code>stopping_strategy=all_exhausted</code> to execute an oversampling strategy. In this case, the dataset construction is stopped as soon as every samples in every dataset has been added at least once. In practice, it means that if a dataset is exhausted, it will return to the beginning of this dataset until the stop criterion has been reached.
214-Note that if no sampling probabilities are specified, the new dataset will have <code>max_length_datasets*nb_dataset samples</code>.
215-There is also <code>stopping_strategy=all_exhausted_without_replacement</code> to ensure that every sample is seen exactly once.</p> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1hfop7z">To ensure proper parallelism using sharding, the shards of the interleaved dataset contain at least 1 shard of every input dataset. Therefore the sharding level of the interleaved dataset is the minimum sharding level of the input datasets.</p> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-pit557">E.g. if the input datasets have respectively 32, 48 and 128 shards, then the interleaved dataset has 32 = min(32, 48, 128) shards, and each new shard has 1 shard from the first dataset, 1-2 shards from the second dataset and 4 shards from the third dataset.</p>  <h2 class="relative group"><a id="rename-remove-and-cast" class="header-link block pr-1.5 text-lg no-hover:hidden with-hover:absolute with-hover:p-1.5 with-hover:opacity-0 with-hover:group-hover:opacity-100 with-hover:right-full" href="#rename-remove-and-cast"><span><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a> <span>Rename, remove, and cast</span></h2> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-mlzv10">The following methods allow you to modify the columns of a dataset. These methods are useful for renaming or removing columns and changing columns to a new set of features.</p>  <h3 class="relative group"><a id="rename" class="header-link block pr-1.5 text-lg no-hover:hidden with-hover:absolute with-hover:p-1.5 with-hover:opacity-0 with-hover:group-hover:opacity-100 with-hover:right-full" href="#rename"><span><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a> <span>Rename</span></h3> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-kss9b1">Use <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.rename_column">IterableDataset.rename_column()</a> when you need to rename a column in your dataset. Features associated with the original column are actually moved under the new column name, instead of just replacing the original column in-place.</p> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1teefwu">Provide <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.rename_column">IterableDataset.rename_column()</a> with the name of the original column, and the new column name:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> datasets <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> load_dataset
216-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset = load_dataset(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;allenai/c4&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;en&#x27;</span>, streaming=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>, split=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;train&#x27;</span>)
217-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset = dataset.rename_column(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;text&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;content&quot;</span>)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div>  <h3 class="relative group"><a id="remove" class="header-link block pr-1.5 text-lg no-hover:hidden with-hover:absolute with-hover:p-1.5 with-hover:opacity-0 with-hover:group-hover:opacity-100 with-hover:right-full" href="#remove"><span><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a> <span>Remove</span></h3> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-vbtarb">When you need to remove one or more columns, give <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.remove_columns">IterableDataset.remove_columns()</a> the name of the column to remove. Remove more than one column by providing a list of column names:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> datasets <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> load_dataset
218-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset = load_dataset(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;allenai/c4&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;en&#x27;</span>, streaming=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>, split=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;train&#x27;</span>)
219-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset = dataset.remove_columns(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;timestamp&#x27;</span>)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div>  <h3 class="relative group"><a id="cast" class="header-link block pr-1.5 text-lg no-hover:hidden with-hover:absolute with-hover:p-1.5 with-hover:opacity-0 with-hover:group-hover:opacity-100 with-hover:right-full" href="#cast"><span><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a> <span>Cast</span></h3> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1ot7z7p"><a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.cast">IterableDataset.cast()</a> changes the feature type of one or more columns. This method takes your new <code>Features</code> as its argument. The following sample code shows how to change the feature types of <code>ClassLabel</code> and <code>Value</code>:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> datasets <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> load_dataset
220-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset = load_dataset(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;nyu-mll/glue&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;mrpc&#x27;</span>, split=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;train&#x27;</span>, streaming=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>)
221-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset.features
222-{<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;sentence1&#x27;</span>: Value(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;string&#x27;</span>),
223-<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;sentence2&#x27;</span>: Value(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;string&#x27;</span>),
224-<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;label&#x27;</span>: ClassLabel(names=[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;not_equivalent&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;equivalent&#x27;</span>]),
225-<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;idx&#x27;</span>: Value(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;int32&#x27;</span>)}
--
281-
282-<span class="hljs-comment"># Create batches of 32 samples</span>
283-batched_dataset = dataset.batch(batch_size=<span class="hljs-number">32</span>)
284-
285-<span class="hljs-comment"># Iterate over the batched dataset</span>
286-<span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> batch <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> batched_dataset:
287-    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(batch)
288-    <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span><!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-z19uc5">In this example, batched_dataset is still an IterableDataset, but each item yielded is now a batch of 32 samples instead of a single sample.
289-This batching is done on-the-fly as you iterate over the dataset, preserving the memory-efficient nature of IterableDataset.</p> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1srxqyd">The batch method also provides a drop_last_batch parameter.
290-When set to True, it will discard the last batch if it’s smaller than the specified batch_size.
291:This can be useful in scenarios where your downstream processing requires all batches to be of the same size:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->batched_dataset = dataset.batch(batch_size=<span class="hljs-number">32</span>, drop_last_batch=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div>  <h2 class="relative group"><a id="stream-in-a-training-loop" class="header-link block pr-1.5 text-lg no-hover:hidden with-hover:absolute with-hover:p-1.5 with-hover:opacity-0 with-hover:group-hover:opacity-100 with-hover:right-full" href="#stream-in-a-training-loop"><span><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a> <span>Stream in a training loop</span></h2> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-19ikuvt"><a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset">IterableDataset</a> can be integrated into a training loop. First, shuffle the dataset:</p> <div class="space-y-10 py-6 2xl:py-8 2xl:-mx-4"> <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-4 relative"><div class="flex h-[22px] mt-[-12.5px] justify-between leading-none"><div class="flex px-1 items-center space-x-1 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><defs><clipPath id="a"><rect x="3.05" y="0.5" width="25.73" height="31" fill="none"></rect></clipPath></defs><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="M24.94,9.51a12.81,12.81,0,0,1,0,18.16,12.68,12.68,0,0,1-18,0,12.81,12.81,0,0,1,0-18.16l9-9V5l-.84.83-6,6a9.58,9.58,0,1,0,13.55,0ZM20.44,9a1.68,1.68,0,1,1,1.67-1.67A1.68,1.68,0,0,1,20.44,9Z" fill="#ee4c2c"></path></g></svg> <span>Pytorch</span></div> <div class="cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center space-x-1 text-sm px-2 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 hover:underline leading-none"><svg class="" width="0.9em" height="0.9em" viewBox="0 0 10 9" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.39125 1.9725L0.0883333 0.669997L0.677917 0.0804138L8.9275 8.33041L8.33792 8.91958L6.95875 7.54041C6.22592 8.00523 5.37572 8.25138 4.50792 8.25C2.26125 8.25 0.392083 6.63333 0 4.5C0.179179 3.52946 0.667345 2.64287 1.39167 1.9725H1.39125ZM5.65667 6.23833L5.04667 5.62833C4.81335 5.73996 4.55116 5.77647 4.29622 5.73282C4.04129 5.68918 3.80617 5.56752 3.62328 5.38463C3.44039 5.20175 3.31874 4.96663 3.27509 4.71169C3.23144 4.45676 3.26795 4.19456 3.37958 3.96125L2.76958 3.35125C2.50447 3.75187 2.38595 4.2318 2.4341 4.70978C2.48225 5.18777 2.6941 5.63442 3.0338 5.97411C3.37349 6.31381 3.82015 6.52567 4.29813 6.57382C4.77611 6.62197 5.25605 6.50345 5.65667 6.23833ZM2.83042 1.06666C3.35 0.862497 3.91625 0.749997 4.50792 0.749997C6.75458 0.749997 8.62375 2.36666 9.01583 4.5C8.88816 5.19404 8.60119 5.84899 8.1775 6.41333L6.56917 4.805C6.61694 4.48317 6.58868 4.15463 6.48664 3.84569C6.3846 3.53675 6.21162 3.256 5.98156 3.02594C5.7515 2.79588 5.47075 2.6229 5.16181 2.52086C4.85287 2.41882 4.52433 2.39056 4.2025 2.43833L2.83042 1.06708V1.06666Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span>Hide Pytorch content</span></div></div> <div class="framework-content"> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>seed, buffer_size = <span class="hljs-number">42</span>, <span class="hljs-number">10_000</span>
292:<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset = dataset.shuffle(seed, buffer_size=buffer_size)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-uyzjf">Lastly, create a simple training loop and start training:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> torch
293-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> torch.utils.data <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> DataLoader
294-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> transformers <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> AutoModelForMaskedLM, DataCollatorForLanguageModeling
295-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> tqdm <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> tqdm
296-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataset = dataset.with_format(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;torch&quot;</span>)
297-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>dataloader = DataLoader(dataset, collate_fn=DataCollatorForLanguageModeling(tokenizer))
298-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>device = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;cuda&#x27;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> torch.cuda.is_available() <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;cpu&#x27;</span> 
299-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>model = AutoModelForMaskedLM.from_pretrained(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;distilbert-base-uncased&quot;</span>)
300-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>model.train().to(device)
301-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>optimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(params=model.parameters(), lr=<span class="hljs-number">1e-5</span>)
302-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> epoch <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(<span class="hljs-number">3</span>):
303-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>    dataset.set_epoch(epoch)
304-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> i, batch <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">enumerate</span>(tqdm(dataloader, total=<span class="hljs-number">5</span>)):
305-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> i == <span class="hljs-number">5</span>:
306-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>            <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>
307-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        batch = {k: v.to(device) <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> k, v <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> batch.items()}
308-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        outputs = model(**batch)
309-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        loss = outputs[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>]
310-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        loss.backward()
311-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        optimizer.step()
312-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        optimizer.zero_grad()
313-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> i % <span class="hljs-number">10</span> == <span class="hljs-number">0</span>:
314-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>            <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;loss: <span class="hljs-subst">{loss}</span>&quot;</span>)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div></div></div>  </div>   <h3 class="relative group"><a id="save-a-dataset-checkpoint-and-resume-iteration" class="header-link block pr-1.5 text-lg no-hover:hidden with-hover:absolute with-hover:p-1.5 with-hover:opacity-0 with-hover:group-hover:opacity-100 with-hover:right-full" href="#save-a-dataset-checkpoint-and-resume-iteration"><span><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M167.594 88.393a8.001 8.001 0 0 1 0 11.314l-67.882 67.882a8 8 0 1 1-11.314-11.315l67.882-67.881a8.003 8.003 0 0 1 11.314 0zm-28.287 84.86l-28.284 28.284a40 40 0 0 1-56.567-56.567l28.284-28.284a8 8 0 0 0-11.315-11.315l-28.284 28.284a56 56 0 0 0 79.196 79.197l28.285-28.285a8 8 0 1 0-11.315-11.314zM212.852 43.14a56.002 56.002 0 0 0-79.196 0l-28.284 28.284a8 8 0 1 0 11.314 11.314l28.284-28.284a40 40 0 0 1 56.568 56.567l-28.285 28.285a8 8 0 0 0 11.315 11.314l28.284-28.284a56.065 56.065 0 0 0 0-79.196z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a> <span>Save a dataset checkpoint and resume iteration</span></h3> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-qoizba">If your training loop stops, you may want to restart the training from where it was. To do so you can save a checkpoint of your model and optimizers, as well as your data loader.</p> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-1436oif">Iterable datasets don’t provide random access to a specific example index to resume from, but you can use <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.state_dict">IterableDataset.state_dict()</a> and <a href="/docs/datasets/v4.8.4/en/package_reference/main_classes#datasets.IterableDataset.load_state_dict">IterableDataset.load_state_dict()</a> to resume from a checkpoint instead, similarly to what you can do for models and optimizers:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>iterable_dataset = Dataset.from_dict({<span class="hljs-string">&quot;a&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(<span class="hljs-number">6</span>)}).to_iterable_dataset(num_shards=<span class="hljs-number">3</span>)
315-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> idx, example <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">enumerate</span>(iterable_dataset):
316-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(example)
317-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> idx == <span class="hljs-number">2</span>:
318-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        state_dict = iterable_dataset.state_dict()
319-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;checkpoint&quot;</span>)
320-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>        <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>
321-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>iterable_dataset.load_state_dict(state_dict)
322-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;restart from checkpoint&quot;</span>)
323-<span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> example <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> iterable_dataset:
324-<span class="hljs-meta">... </span>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(example)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></pre></div> <p data-svelte-h="svelte-f816x">Returns:</p> <div class="code-block relative "><div class="absolute top-2.5 right-4"><button class="inline-flex items-center relative text-sm focus:text-green-500 cursor-pointer focus:outline-none transition duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 mx-0.5   text-gray-600 " title="code excerpt" type="button"><svg class="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" focusable="false" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M28,10V28H10V10H28m0-2H10a2,2,0,0,0-2,2V28a2,2,0,0,0,2,2H28a2,2,0,0,0,2-2V10a2,2,0,0,0-2-2Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><path d="M4,18H2V4A2,2,0,0,1,4,2H18V4H4Z" transform="translate(0)"></path><rect fill="none" width="32" height="32"></rect></svg> <div class="absolute pointer-events-none transition-opacity bg-black text-white py-1 px-2 leading-tight rounded font-normal shadow left-1/2 top-full transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-2 opacity-0"><div class="absolute bottom-full left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-black border-4 border-t-0" style="border-left-color: transparent; border-right-color: transparent; "></div> Copied</div></button></div> <pre class=""><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->{<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0</span>}
