170-</figure>
171-<div class="ltx_para" id="S2.SS2.p4">
172:<p class="ltx_p" id="S2.SS2.p4.13">Next, we describe the proposed BMGD algorithm in detail. We let <math alttext="\widehat{\theta}^{(t,m)}_{r,k}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4a"><msubsup id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.cmml"><mover accent="true" id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2.cmml"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2.2.cmml">θ</mi><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2.1.cmml">^</mo></mover><mrow id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.4.2.4" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.4.2.3.cmml"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.3.3.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.3.3.1.1.cmml">r</mi><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.4.2.4.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.4.2.3.cmml">,</mo><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.4.2.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.4.2.2.cmml">k</mi></mrow><mrow id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.4" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.3.cmml"><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.4.1" stretchy="false" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.3.cmml">(</mo><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.1.1.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.1.1.1.1.cmml">t</mi><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.4.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.3.cmml">,</mo><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.2.cmml">m</mi><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.4.3" stretchy="false" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.3.cmml">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4b"><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5">subscript</csymbol><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5">superscript</csymbol><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2.1">^</ci><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.5.2.2.2">𝜃</ci></apply><interval closure="open" id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.4"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.1.1.1.1">𝑡</ci><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.2.2.2.2">𝑚</ci></interval></apply><list id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.4.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.4.2.4"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.3.3.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.3.3.1.1">𝑟</ci><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.4.2.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4.4.2.2">𝑘</ci></list></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4c">\widehat{\theta}^{(t,m)}_{r,k}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.1.m1.4d">over^ start_ARG italic_θ end_ARG start_POSTSUPERSCRIPT ( italic_t , italic_m ) end_POSTSUPERSCRIPT start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_r , italic_k end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> be the estimator obtained in the <math alttext="r" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.2.m2.1"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.2.m2.1a"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.cmml">r</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.2.m2.1b"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.2.m2.1.1">𝑟</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.2.m2.1c">r</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.2.m2.1d">italic_r</annotation></semantics></math>-th iteration on the <math alttext="k" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.3.m3.1"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.3.m3.1a"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.3.m3.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.3.m3.1.1.cmml">k</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.3.m3.1b"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.3.m3.1.1">𝑘</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.3.m3.1c">k</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.3.m3.1d">italic_k</annotation></semantics></math>-th buffer and in the <math alttext="t" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.4.m4.1"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.4.m4.1a"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.4.m4.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.4.m4.1.1.cmml">t</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.4.m4.1b"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.4.m4.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.4.m4.1.1">𝑡</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.4.m4.1c">t</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.4.m4.1d">italic_t</annotation></semantics></math>-th epoch computed on the <math alttext="m" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.5.m5.1"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.5.m5.1a"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.5.m5.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.5.m5.1.1.cmml">m</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.5.m5.1b"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.5.m5.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.5.m5.1.1">𝑚</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.5.m5.1c">m</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.5.m5.1d">italic_m</annotation></semantics></math>-th mini-batch. Here, <math alttext="1\leq t\leq T" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1a"><mrow id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.cmml"><mn id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.2.cmml">1</mn><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.3" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.3.cmml">≤</mo><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.4" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.4.cmml">t</mi><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.5" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.5.cmml">≤</mo><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.6" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.6.cmml">T</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1b"><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1"><and id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1a.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1"></and><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1b.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1"><leq id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.3"></leq><cn id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.2.cmml" type="integer" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.2">1</cn><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.4.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.4">𝑡</ci></apply><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1c.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1"><leq id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.5.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.5"></leq><share href="#S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.4.cmml" id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1d.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1"></share><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.6.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1.1.6">𝑇</ci></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1c">1\leq t\leq T</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.6.m6.1d">1 ≤ italic_t ≤ italic_T</annotation></semantics></math> and <math alttext="1\leq r\leq R" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1a"><mrow id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.cmml"><mn id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.2.cmml">1</mn><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.3" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.3.cmml">≤</mo><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.4" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.4.cmml">r</mi><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.5" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.5.cmml">≤</mo><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.6" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.6.cmml">R</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1b"><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1"><and id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1a.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1"></and><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1b.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1"><leq id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.3"></leq><cn id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.2.cmml" type="integer" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.2">1</cn><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.4.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.4">𝑟</ci></apply><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1c.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1"><leq id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.5.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.5"></leq><share href="#S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.4.cmml" id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1d.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1"></share><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.6.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1.1.6">𝑅</ci></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1c">1\leq r\leq R</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.7.m7.1d">1 ≤ italic_r ≤ italic_R</annotation></semantics></math> for some prespecified number of buffer epochs <math alttext="T" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.8.m8.1"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.8.m8.1a"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.8.m8.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.8.m8.1.1.cmml">T</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.8.m8.1b"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.8.m8.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.8.m8.1.1">𝑇</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.8.m8.1c">T</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.8.m8.1d">italic_T</annotation></semantics></math> and iterations <math alttext="R" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.9.m9.1"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.9.m9.1a"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.9.m9.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.9.m9.1.1.cmml">R</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.9.m9.1b"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.9.m9.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.9.m9.1.1">𝑅</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.9.m9.1c">R</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.9.m9.1d">italic_R</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively. First, in one single iteration, all buffers should be sequentially processed from <math alttext="\mathcal{S}_{r,1}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2a"><msub id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.3" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.3.cmml"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.3.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.3.2.cmml">𝒮</mi><mrow id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.2.2.4" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.2.2.3.cmml"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.1.1.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.1.1.1.1.cmml">r</mi><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.2.2.4.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.2.2.3.cmml">,</mo><mn id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.2.2.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.2.2.2.cmml">1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2b"><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.3">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.3.2">𝒮</ci><list id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.2.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.2.2.4"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.1.1.1.1">𝑟</ci><cn id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.2.2.2.cmml" type="integer" xref="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2.2.2.2">1</cn></list></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2c">\mathcal{S}_{r,1}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.10.m10.2d">caligraphic_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_r , 1 end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> to <math alttext="\mathcal{S}_{r,K}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2a"><msub id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.3" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.3.cmml"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.3.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.3.2.cmml">𝒮</mi><mrow id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.2.2.4" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.2.2.3.cmml"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.1.1.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.1.1.1.1.cmml">r</mi><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.2.2.4.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.2.2.3.cmml">,</mo><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.2.2.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.2.2.2.cmml">K</mi></mrow></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2b"><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.3">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.3.2">𝒮</ci><list id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.2.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.2.2.4"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.1.1.1.1">𝑟</ci><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2.2.2.2">𝐾</ci></list></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2c">\mathcal{S}_{r,K}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.11.m11.2d">caligraphic_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_r , italic_K end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math>. Then, for each buffer <math alttext="\mathcal{S}_{r,k}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2a"><msub id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.3" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.3.cmml"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.3.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.3.2.cmml">𝒮</mi><mrow id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.2.2.4" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.2.2.3.cmml"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.1.1.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.1.1.1.1.cmml">r</mi><mo id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.2.2.4.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.2.2.3.cmml">,</mo><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.2.2.2" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.2.2.2.cmml">k</mi></mrow></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2b"><apply id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.3">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.3.2">𝒮</ci><list id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.2.2.3.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.2.2.4"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.1.1.1.1">𝑟</ci><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.2.2.2.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2.2.2.2">𝑘</ci></list></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2c">\mathcal{S}_{r,k}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.12.m12.2d">caligraphic_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_r , italic_k end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math>, in the <math alttext="t" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.SS2.p4.13.m13.1"><semantics id="S2.SS2.p4.13.m13.1a"><mi id="S2.SS2.p4.13.m13.1.1" xref="S2.SS2.p4.13.m13.1.1.cmml">t</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S2.SS2.p4.13.m13.1b"><ci id="S2.SS2.p4.13.m13.1.1.cmml" xref="S2.SS2.p4.13.m13.1.1">𝑡</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S2.SS2.p4.13.m13.1c">t</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S2.SS2.p4.13.m13.1d">italic_t</annotation></semantics></math>-th epoch, we should update parameter estimates based on the following updating rule:</p>
