457-<section id="checkpointing">
458-<h2>Checkpointing<a class="headerlink" href="#checkpointing" title="Link to this heading">#</a></h2>
459-<p>We provide <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Checkpoint{Save|Restore}</span></code> to checkpoint the
460-<code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">DatasetIterator</span></code>. It is recommended to use it with
461-<a class="reference external" href="https://orbax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html">Orbax</a>, which can checkpoint
462-both, input pipeline and model, and handles the edge cases for distributed
463-training.</p>
